    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located midway between Kilmacrennan (3km approx.) and Termon (2km approx.) is this compact 39.4 acre farm. A minor public road forms the farm boundary on one side, creating extensive road frontage and the possibility of sites subject to planning permission. Land type is approximately two thirds good grassland and one third hill grazing. A farmyard with a range of stone outbuildings plus a large concrete surfaced yard is situated beside the public road. Comprising all of folios DL27307 and DL27306. \n\nInitial offers in writing will be accepted until 5:30pm on Thursday 4th June (unless previously sold). All enquiries welcome."
